Z||000000||fiero56||08-21-2000||11:42 PM||||Getting all my info together to rebuild a camaro/firebird 3.4L. What books/websites, etc, that anyone recommends I take a look at would be appreciated. Particularly books pertaining to the Cheverolet 60 degree v-6 would be nice, but anything with good information would be appreciated.||||reg||5
Z||000001||terryk||08-22-2000||01:32 AM||||<BR>How to Rebuilt Your GM V-6 60 Degree Engine by Tom Currao ISBN 0-87938-841-2 $19.95 for most book stores. A must have!<P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||fierosound||08-22-2000||08:14 PM||||Presently doing a 3.4L install myself.  I found these sites to be of great help.<P><BR>3.4L Fiero engine buildup   <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/on/freddysplace/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.angelfire.com/on/freddysplace/</A> <P>3/4L S-15 engine buildup   <A HREF="http://www.s-series.org/htm/windstorm/project-windstorm.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.s-series.org/htm/windstorm/project-windstorm.htm</A> <P>What's involved using Camaro 3.4L   <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/on/fierofactory/start.html#34" TARGET=_blank>http://www.angelfire.com/on/fierofactory/start.html#34</A> <P>Fiero 60 degree V6 mods   <A HREF="http://www.users.uswest.net/~racing2win/mild2wld.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.users.uswest.net/~racing2win/mild2wld.htm</A> <P>Rebuilding a 60 degree V6 - bores/displacements    <A HREF="http://hometown.aol.com/gpxss/rebuild/rebuild.html" TARGET=_blank>http://hometown.aol.com/gpxss/rebuild/rebuild.html</A> <P>Norris Racing   60 degree V6 performance products   <A HREF="http://www.norrisracingtech.com/home.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.norrisracingtech.com/home.html</A> <P>WhiteHorse perfomance engines    <A HREF="http://www.kitcar.com/whitehorse/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.kitcar.com/whitehorse/</A> <P>Intelligent mods - what to do, what to avoid    <A HREF="http://www.sdsefi.com/techmods.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.sdsefi.com/techmods.htm</A> ||||reg||10
